WEBVTT

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:16.497
Whoa! The compass!

00:00:16.937 --> 00:00:18.477
This will lead us
to the Emerald!

00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:26.398
Hey, you got
a little something on your--

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:29.508
Oh, no.
Tails, get back.

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:35.417
Run!
[Tails yelps]

00:00:36.064 --> 00:00:37.763
[both gasp]

00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:42.495
[Robotnik yodeling]

00:00:42.618 --> 00:00:43.918
[sighs]
That guy again?

00:00:44.138 --> 00:00:45.757
Heads up,
my little stalagmites.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.078
Someone call an Uber?

00:00:48.718 --> 00:00:50.837
Hey, thanks for doing
all the hard stuff.

00:00:50.942 --> 00:00:53.115
[grunts]

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:55.887
But we'll take it from here.

00:00:56.827 --> 00:00:58.987
Okay, we really gotta talk
about your new look.

00:00:59.107 --> 00:01:01.727
It's like Professor X
meets the Monopoly man.

00:01:02.047 --> 00:01:05.567
And what kind of genius
shows up to Siberia
in a convertible?

00:01:05.807 --> 00:01:08.667
The kind of genius
that can turn up the heat...

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.767
with a flick of a switch.

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:19.133
[grunts]

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.797
Oh! Whoo! [laughs]

00:01:23.768 --> 00:01:26.388
Good one!
I'm sure that wasn't important.

00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:30.618
Tails, that's our exit.
Come on.

00:01:36.047 --> 00:01:37.516
[growls]

00:01:40.782 --> 00:01:42.176
[yelps]

00:01:44.268 --> 00:01:45.928
Uh-huh.
Let's split up.

00:01:46.308 --> 00:01:47.788
You go high, I go low.

00:01:47.848 --> 00:01:48.848
Right.

00:01:48.888 --> 00:01:51.128
Quick little stretch
and here we go.

00:01:52.379 --> 00:01:54.586
[laughs]

00:02:03.268 --> 00:02:04.268
[Sonic]
Oh, so you want to play?

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:10.567
That's new.

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:12.878
Whoa. [screams]

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:20.617
[exclaiming]

00:02:22.017 --> 00:02:23.418
Sonic!

00:02:23.523 --> 00:02:24.609
[yells]

00:02:24.713 --> 00:02:26.604
[yelping]

00:02:36.585 --> 00:02:38.231
Snowball fight!

00:02:41.977 --> 00:02:43.413
[Sonic laughs]

00:02:43.518 --> 00:02:47.198
It's too easy.
Come on, challenge me!

00:02:47.304 --> 00:02:48.800
[gasps]

00:02:52.611 --> 00:02:54.534
["A Summer Place" playing]

00:02:56.386 --> 00:03:01.301
♪ There's a summer place♪

00:03:01.408 --> 00:03:04.308
[Sonic] We are talking style
and pizzazz.

00:03:04.436 --> 00:03:07.814
♪ Where it may rain or storm♪

00:03:07.941 --> 00:03:10.379
Pew-pew-pew!
Pew, pew, pew, pew, pew, pew.

00:03:10.507 --> 00:03:12.688
♪ Yet I'm safe and warm♪

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:14.618
Yeah!
I make this look good.

00:03:15.677 --> 00:03:17.003
[grunts]

00:03:17.118 --> 00:03:18.857
Oh, great.
The Winter Soldier.

00:03:26.018 --> 00:03:29.018
For a guy named Knuckles,
you are really bad at punching.

00:03:29.638 --> 00:03:32.178
Surrender the compass!
You are no match for me.

00:03:32.518 --> 00:03:34.878
I've been training for this
my entire life.

00:03:35.018 --> 00:03:38.578
And I had no training at all,
yet here I am ahead of you.

00:03:38.798 --> 00:03:40.158
That's gotta be
embarrassing.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.630
[yelps]

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:48.028
[gasps] My rings!

00:03:51.168 --> 00:03:54.608
Has anyone ever told you
you've got serious anger issues?

00:03:55.347 --> 00:03:57.508
You mock me
with your weak jokes,

00:03:57.727 --> 00:03:59.687
but you know nothing
about me, hedgehog.

00:03:59.827 --> 00:04:04.147
Well, I know you Echidnas
have a habit of showing up
uninvited and ruining my life.

00:04:04.428 --> 00:04:07.167
Ruining your life?
Another bad joke.

00:04:07.468 --> 00:04:10.107
I lost everything
because of you.

00:04:10.627 --> 00:04:13.287
My tribe was on the verge
of its greatest victory.

00:04:13.887 --> 00:04:16.528
The last of the Owl warriors
had been located.

00:04:16.968 --> 00:04:20.367
Soon Longclaw's Emerald secrets
would be ours.

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:23.887
But my father stopped me
from joining the fight.

00:04:24.307 --> 00:04:27.108
He said my moment
to honor our tribe would come,

00:04:27.488 --> 00:04:29.387
but it was not this moment.

00:04:30.028 --> 00:04:32.208
Those were the last words
he spoke to me.

00:04:32.727 --> 00:04:34.527
I never saw him again.

00:04:36.007 --> 00:04:38.287
We both lost everything
that day.

00:04:39.725 --> 00:04:40.982
[Echidnas yelling]

00:04:41.118 --> 00:04:42.118
Goodbye, Sonic.
No!

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:44.504
Longclaw!

00:04:46.545 --> 00:04:48.315
[groaning]

00:04:49.047 --> 00:04:50.607
Sonic! Are you okay?

00:04:51.187 --> 00:04:52.187
Deceiver!

00:04:52.987 --> 00:04:54.607
No,
it wasn't a trick.

00:04:55.627 --> 00:04:58.007
Tails, take the compass
and get out of here!

00:05:01.223 --> 00:05:02.380
Yeah!

00:05:03.718 --> 00:05:04.718
Later, haters!

00:05:08.968 --> 00:05:09.968
Tails!

00:05:17.218 --> 00:05:18.578
Tails, come on.
Wake up.

00:05:19.178 --> 00:05:21.618
He chose helping the fox
over pursuing the compass.

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:22.997
Of course he did.

00:05:23.557 --> 00:05:25.737
New friend,
same pathetic weakness.

00:05:25.852 --> 00:05:28.375
Hmm.

00:05:28.489 --> 00:05:30.593
[rumbling]

00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:32.083
[gasps]

00:05:36.977 --> 00:05:39.757
Oh, no. No, no, no.
We're in real trouble here.

00:05:39.857 --> 00:05:42.537
Come on, Tails. I need you
to fly us out of here.
Time to wake up.

00:05:49.868 --> 00:05:52.628
See ya, kids.
Enjoy the fresh powder.

00:05:54.331 --> 00:05:56.279
[grunting]

00:05:56.384 --> 00:05:59.828
[ukulele music playing]

00:06:02.054 --> 00:06:03.515
[guests murmuring]

00:06:06.854 --> 00:06:10.089
[airplane passing overhead]

00:06:10.785 --> 00:06:13.602
[guests applauding]

00:06:18.194 --> 00:06:19.445
Did you...

00:06:24.768 --> 00:06:27.948
These rings signify the--

00:06:28.066 --> 00:06:30.719
[phone ringtone]

00:06:34.478 --> 00:06:35.158
[laughs] Sorry.

00:06:35.158 --> 00:06:36.218
Thought it was on silent.
[ringtone stops]

00:06:43.288 --> 00:06:44.288
These rings--
[phone ringtone]

00:06:46.567 --> 00:06:48.067
So help me, Thomas!

00:06:49.255 --> 00:06:51.559
[stammering]

00:06:52.818 --> 00:06:54.238
Okay, sorry. Sorry.

00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:55.758
Excuse me,
this is an emergency.

00:06:57.658 --> 00:06:58.658
Sorry.

00:07:02.035 --> 00:07:04.162
[phone ringing]

00:07:04.588 --> 00:07:07.048
What?
This better be important.
I just--

00:07:07.468 --> 00:07:08.468
Are you skiing?

00:07:08.727 --> 00:07:10.727
Snowboarding, actually.
But I need your help now.

00:07:10.907 --> 00:07:13.067
Life or death situation
this very second.

00:07:13.367 --> 00:07:16.367
I need you to use the ring
I gave you to save me.
Like right now.

00:07:16.607 --> 00:07:18.827
Okay, slow down.
I don't even know
where you are.

00:07:18.827 --> 00:07:20.847
You just gotta picture
where you want the ring to go.

00:07:21.047 --> 00:07:22.047
So picture this.

00:07:24.631 --> 00:07:27.460
Oh, my God.
Okay, okay. Hang on.

